# Line endings are LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# The rebuild is worked on from Windows and Linux. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf rewrites every file it touches to CRLF and the
# next commit is a wall of whole-file diffs — and the parity harness reads the
# legacy Apps Script byte for byte, so it must see the same bytes everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.lock binary
